 r←Initial ps
⍝ Prepares the test cases; `ps` is the parameter space handed over by `Tester2`.\\
⍝ In batch mode no questions are asked: the tests are carried out, and the API in
⍝ `#.CommTools.CommTools` is the one exercised.
 C←##.CommTools
 :If ps.batchFlag
     r←1
     ∆Ref2CommTools←#.CommTools.CommTools
 :Else
     r←1 C.YesOrNo'Note: most test cases need a user for interactions',LF,'Would you like to carry out the tests anyway?'
     :If 1 C.YesOrNo'Execute API in #.CommTools.CommTools? (No=⎕SE.CommTools)'
         ∆Ref2CommTools←#.CommTools.CommTools
     :Else
         ∆Ref2CommTools←⎕SE.CommTools
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
⍝Done
